(ns brotli.fixtures
  "Small brotli streams produced by the reference `brotli` CLI, recorded here as
   base64 so the portable suite can exercise the real decoder on a runtime with no
   shell — nbb, a browser, anywhere.

   Regenerate with the reference encoder if you add cases; do not hand-edit.
   Larger and broader fixtures are generated on the fly by
   `test/brotli/oracle_test.cljk`.")

